@startuml sd_us221
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US221 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Maintenance Supervisor" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "MaintenanceController" as MaintenanceController
participant "ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase" as ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== GET /api/maintenance/records/turnaround/model/{modelName} ==
Actor -> EAM : GET /api/maintenance/records/turnaround/model/{modelName}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> MaintenanceController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
MaintenanceController -> ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase : execute(...)
ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase -> DBAM : own aircraft
ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase -> PAM : GET /internal/replicas/aircrafts\n(every peer in parallel)
PAM --> ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase : their aircraft
ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase -> DBAM : own maintenance records
ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase -> PAM : GET /internal/replicas/maintenance-records\n(every peer in parallel)
PAM --> ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase : their maintenance records
ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase -> DBAM : aircraft models (catalog, complete here)
ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase -> ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase : keep the latest change of each record,\nleave out deleted ones; filter, compute, sort, page
ViewAverageMaintenanceTurnaroundUseCase --> MaintenanceController : result
MaintenanceController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id; X-Partial-Result if both holders of a record were unreachable)
@enduml
